    <!-- =====================================================================
         Midgard Studio — English string table (neutral / fallback).

         THIS FILE IS THE FALLBACK. Every key used in the app via
         {DynamicResource Key} or LocalizationService.Get("Key") must exist
         here, or the value degrades to the key name. When you add a new
         translatable string, add its English value here AND a translated
         value in zh-CN.xaml.

         Key convention: <Area>_<Element>[_<Detail>], e.g. Menu_File,
         Nav_Items, Btn_Save, Dlg_Quit_Title.
         ===================================================================== -->

