    <!-- ===== AboutDialog ===== -->
    <s:String x:Key="About_Title">About Midgard Studio</s:String>
    <s:String x:Key="About_TitleBar">About</s:String>
    <s:String x:Key="About_Description">A native studio for building Ragnarok Online server content. It edits the server databases — items, monsters, skills, pets, item groups, combos and more — alongside the client data: item info, sprites, icons and the GRF browser. The Item Forge creates a complete item across server and client in one pass, with live sprite and icon previews.</s:String>
    <s:String x:Key="About_SafetyNote">Your base data stays safe. Edits are written to the import layer and the custom itemInfo file using in-place splicing — existing entries, comments and helper functions are preserved, and the original base files are never modified.</s:String>
    <s:String x:Key="About_CreatedBy">Created by </s:String>
    <s:String x:Key="About_Close">Close</s:String>

