    <s:String x:Key="Settings_Language_Chinese">中文 (简体)</s:String>
    <s:String x:Key="Settings_Language_English">English</s:String>

    <s:String x:Key="Settings_SaveBehaviour">Saving behaviour</s:String>
    <s:String x:Key="Settings_SaveBehaviour_Desc">Choose when edits are written to disk. Auto-save writes safely (in-place, never overwriting your functions) but only manual saves create a dated restore point in the Backup Manager.</s:String>
    <s:String x:Key="Settings_Save_Manual">Manual save</s:String>
    <s:String x:Key="Settings_Save_Manual_Desc">Files are written only when you click Save (Ctrl+S). Recommended.</s:String>
    <s:String x:Key="Settings_Save_Interval">Save every N seconds</s:String>
    <s:String x:Key="Settings_Save_Interval_Label">Interval (seconds):</s:String>
    <s:String x:Key="Settings_Save_Interval_Desc">Pending changes are written automatically on this timer (minimum 5 seconds).</s:String>
    <s:String x:Key="Settings_Save_OnEdit">Auto-save on edits</s:String>
    <s:String x:Key="Settings_Save_OnEdit_Desc">Changes are written a moment after you stop editing.</s:String>

    <s:String x:Key="Settings_Backups">Backups</s:String>
    <s:String x:Key="Settings_Backups_Keep">Keep the newest</s:String>
    <s:String x:Key="Settings_Backups_PerProfile">snapshots per profile</s:String>
    <s:String x:Key="Settings_Backups_Desc">A dated snapshot is saved after every manual save and before every restore. Older snapshots beyond this count are pruned automatically. Manage them in Tools ▸ Backup Manager.</s:String>

    <s:String x:Key="Settings_Gate">Validation gate</s:String>
    <s:String x:Key="Settings_Gate_Desc">How a manual save reacts to Error-level validation issues in the entries you're about to write. Warnings and info never block. Auto-save and exit-save are never interrupted.</s:String>
    <s:String x:Key="Settings_Gate_CheckBefore">Check validation before a manual save</s:String>
    <s:String x:Key="Settings_Gate_Soft">Soft gate</s:String>
    <s:String x:Key="Settings_Gate_Soft_Desc">Lists the errors and lets you Save anyway or stop to fix them. Recommended.</s:String>
    <s:String x:Key="Settings_Gate_Hard">Hard gate</s:String>
    <s:String x:Key="Settings_Gate_Hard_Desc">Blocks a manual save until the Error-level issues are fixed.</s:String>
    <s:String x:Key="Settings_Gate_Advisory">Advisory only</s:String>
    <s:String x:Key="Settings_Gate_Advisory_Desc">Never inspects validation on save; issues appear only in the Validation panel and inline.</s:String>

    <s:String x:Key="Settings_Shortcuts">Keyboard shortcuts</s:String>
    <s:String x:Key="Settings_Shortcuts_Desc">Click a field and press the keys you want — including combinations like Ctrl+Shift+F. Changes apply immediately. Backspace clears a shortcut; Esc cancels.</s:String>
    <s:String x:Key="Settings_Shortcuts_Placeholder">Press a shortcut…</s:String>

    <s:String x:Key="Settings_About_Card_Desc">A native editor for Ragnarok server databases and client files — server YAML, client Lua, item combos, drops and sprites in one place.</s:String>
    <s:String x:Key="Settings_About_Author">Author</s:String>
    <s:String x:Key="Settings_About_Edition">Edition</s:String>
    <s:String x:Key="Settings_About_EditionValue">Desktop (Windows)</s:String>

