    <s:String x:Key="Msg_SaveFailed_Title">Save failed</s:String>
    <s:String x:Key="Msg_SaveFailed_Body">Your changes were NOT fully saved and are still here in the editor:</s:String>
    <s:String x:Key="Msg_SaveFailed_Tail">Close anything that might be using these files (for example a running server), then save again.</s:String>
    <s:String x:Key="Msg_ValErrors_Title">Validation errors</s:String>
    <s:String x:Key="Msg_ValErrors_HardGate_Tail">Fix these Error-level issues before saving (hard gate is enabled).</s:String>
